  "title": "Deleting AppZones",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://help.zscaler.com/microsegmentation/deleting-appzones",
    "node": "1531944",
    "revision": "3243090",
    "updated": "2026-11-02",
    "updated_basis": "pdf-last-modified"
  },
  "captured_at": "2026-11-04",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "Admins can configure, edit, and delete AppZones as needed."
    },
    {
      "text": "When you delete an AppZone, its matched flow doesn't appear in Flow Logs and any related resources become unmapped."
    },
    {
      "text": "To delete an AppZone:"
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Zero Trust Cloud > Microsegmentation > App Zones.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          32,
          48
        ],
        [
          51,
          68
        ],
        [
          71,
          80
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Delete icon for the AppZone you want to delete.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          16
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Delete AppZone window appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          18
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Delete AppZone window:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          21
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Enter CONFIRM.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Delete.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The page refreshes and removes the AppZone from the list."
    }
  ]
}
